# LeakSanitizer suppressions for run-sanitizers.sh. Each entry is a known,
# pre-existing defect, named so it can be fixed and dropped from here.
#
# BaseMockInitializer allocates the two mock factories with new and hands
# WebAppFactoryManagerMock raw pointers it never deletes: 16 bytes each,
# per test that uses the initializer. Test-code leak.
leak:BaseMockInitializer
